{"seq":2,"slug":"hit-reactions-hitstun","title":"受击反应与硬直","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hit-reactions-hitstun","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"受击反应与硬直\">受击反应与硬直</h1><p>攻击框相交、命中成立的下一瞬，问题从「打没打中」变成「打中之后对方怎么了」。受击方不会原地不动地掉血——它会被打得身体一震、脚步踉跄、甚至浮空倒地。这些受击反应既是给玩家的视觉反馈，又是悄悄打开的一扇时间窗：正是受击硬直创造了<a href=\"../systems-depth/combo-system-design\">连招</a>得以成立的空当。这一篇把<a href=\"hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">上一篇</a>的命中布尔值，翻译成受击方的一段状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从命中到受击状态\">核心概念：从命中到受击状态</h2><p>命中事件不直接改血条，而是先把受击方推入一个「受击状态」，由这个状态决定硬直时长、位移、能否被追击。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[命中事件] --&gt; B{受击方在防御?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[防御硬直 Blockstun&lt;br/&gt;削减伤害/削韧]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[受击硬直 Hitstun]&#10;  D --&gt; E{攻击属性}&#10;  E --&gt;|普通| F[原地受击 站立硬直]&#10;  E --&gt;|击退| G[后退位移]&#10;  E --&gt;|击飞| H[浮空 Launch]&#10;  E --&gt;|击倒| I[倒地 Knockdown]&#10;  H --&gt; J[空中连段窗口]&#10;  I --&gt; K[起身 Wakeup 博弈]\">flowchart TD\n  A[命中事件] --&gt; B{受击方在防御?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[防御硬直 Blockstun&lt;br/&gt;削减伤害/削韧]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[受击硬直 Hitstun]\n  D --&gt; E{攻击属性}\n  E --&gt;|普通| F[原地受击 站立硬直]\n  E --&gt;|击退| G[后退位移]\n  E --&gt;|击飞| H[浮空 Launch]\n  E --&gt;|击倒| I[倒地 Knockdown]\n  H --&gt; J[空中连段窗口]\n  I --&gt; K[起身 Wakeup 博弈]</pre><ul>\n<li>受击硬直（hitstun）：被击中后无法行动的帧数，决定了攻击方能否继续追击。</li>\n<li>防御硬直（blockstun）：成功防御时无法行动的帧数，通常短于同招的 hitstun，这是「防御方略占优」的根源。</li>\n<li>受击状态类型：站立硬直、击退、浮空、倒地，各自对应不同的后续博弈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"硬直时长与帧优势的来源\">硬直时长与帧优势的来源</h2><p>硬直时长是<a href=\"../foundations/action-states-frame-data\">帧优势公式</a>里的关键变量。回顾该公式：你的帧优势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= s - r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 正是你给对手施加的硬直帧。因此「硬直多长」直接决定「这招打完安不安全、能不能连」。</p>\n<p>设计上常让 hitstun 与 blockstun 拉开差距：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>advantage</mtext><mtext>命中</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>hit</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>advantage</mtext><mtext>防御</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{advantage}_{\\text{命中}} = s_{\\text{hit}} - r, \\qquad \\text{advantage}_{\\text{防御}} = s_{\\text{block}} - r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">advantage</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">命中</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">advantage</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">防御</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>hit</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{hit}} &gt; s_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同一招在命中时可能 +4（可连段），在被防御时却是 -2（有风险）。这个差值是格斗游戏「该不该贴身压制」决策的数学核心。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>受击状态</th>\n<th>典型硬直</th>\n<th>攻击方可做什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>防御硬直</td>\n<td>较短</td>\n<td>继续施压或撤退，需防确反</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站立硬直</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>可能接<a href=\"../systems-depth/combo-system-design\">连段</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮空</td>\n<td>较长</td>\n<td>空中连段，伤害常受<a href=\"damage-formulas-scaling\">缩放</a>递减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倒地</td>\n<td>固定+起身</td>\n<td>起身择（wakeup）博弈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"击退-击飞与位移\">击退、击飞与位移</h2><p>受击反应往往伴随位移。击退（knockback）把受击方沿攻击方向推开，常用一个随伤害或招式权重缩放的初速度建模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext>kb</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_{\\text{kb}} = k \\cdot \\hat{d} \\cdot w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是击退方向、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是招式的击退权重、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是全局系数。击飞（launch）则给一个向上的初速度，让受击方进入抛物线下落，开启空中连段。这里的位移是「逻辑受击位移」，由战斗系统直接驱动，与物理引擎基于质量和摩擦的<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/impulse-resolution\">冲量求解</a>是两回事——战斗位移要的是「可预测、可连段」，而非物理真实。一些游戏（如《任天堂明星大乱斗》）反其道而行，让击退量随累计伤害增长，把「受击」本身变成核心博弈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"韧性与受身-打断硬直的机制\">韧性与受身：打断硬直的机制</h2><p>如果任何攻击都能让对手进入硬直，强者就能无限压制。因此现代战斗系统普遍引入「韧性 / 削韧」机制来限制硬直链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>韧性（poise / super armor）：受击方有一条隐藏韧性条，攻击削减韧性而非立即触发硬直，韧性破才进入硬直。重型敌人韧性高，普攻打不动，必须用重击或处决破韧。</li>\n<li>受身（tech / recovery）：受击方在浮空或倒地时按特定输入可提前恢复，缩短被连段的时长，把「挨打」变成有限的反抗博弈。</li>\n<li>霸体帧（hyper armor）：某些重型招式起手自带护甲，受击不进硬直，鼓励「以伤换伤」的搏命打法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些机制共同把「硬直」从一个死板的数值，变成攻防双方都能干预的博弈维度。韧性数值如何与伤害协同，是<a href=\"../balance-feel/weapon-ability-balancing\">武器与技能平衡</a>要统一考量的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"受击反应的表现层\">受击反应的表现层</h2><p>逻辑上的受击状态需要表现层来「卖」出去。受击动画通常做成可被打断的轻量片段，并按受击方向分出前/后/左/右多个变体；引擎根据攻击方向选对应动画，让踉跄方向和挨打方向一致。受击动画的播放与打断属于动画系统，本篇只强调它必须严格服从逻辑硬直时长——动画再长，逻辑硬直一结束，控制权就该立即还给玩家，否则会产生「明明能动了却卡在受击动画里」的失控感。这种「逻辑先行、表现跟随」的原则，是受击手感的底线。</p>\n<p>至于让受击「看起来痛」的顿帧、震屏、血液特效，属于<a href=\"../balance-feel/combat-feel-feedback\">打击感与反馈</a>的范畴，这里只点明：受击状态是它们的触发点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>命中不直接改血条，而是先把受击方推入受击状态：防御硬直、站立硬直、击退、浮空、倒地，各开不同博弈。</li>\n<li>硬直帧是帧优势公式里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>；让 hitstun 大于 blockstun，造就「命中可连、被防有险」的核心攻防数学。</li>\n<li>击退/击飞用逻辑受击位移驱动（求可连段而非物理真实）；韧性、受身、霸体帧把硬直变成双方可干预的博弈。</li>\n<li>受击表现层必须服从逻辑硬直时长——逻辑先行、表现跟随，是不产生失控感的底线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">攻击框与受击框系统</a> —— 受击状态的触发源（命中判定）。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../systems-depth/combo-system-design\">连招系统设计</a> —— 受击硬直开出的时间窗如何被串成连段。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-ai/npc-behavior/perception-system\">感知系统</a> —— AI 敌人如何「感知」自己挨打并做出反应。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"受击反应与硬直","id":"受击反应与硬直"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从命中到受击状态","id":"核心概念-从命中到受击状态"},{"level":2,"text":"硬直时长与帧优势的来源","id":"硬直时长与帧优势的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"击退、击飞与位移","id":"击退-击飞与位移"},{"level":2,"text":"韧性与受身：打断硬直的机制","id":"韧性与受身-打断硬直的机制"},{"level":2,"text":"受击反应的表现层","id":"受击反应的表现层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"攻击框与受击框系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems"},"next":{"title":"伤害公式与数值缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling"}}